<h1>New publication</h1>
<p class="muted">
  <% if Current.account.subscribed? %>
    Adds $29/month to your subscription<% if Current.account.trialing? %> once your free trial ends<% end %>.
    You'll land on Setup: merge tag, embed block, and branding, all on one page.
  <% else %>
    Creating it starts your 30-day free trial — then $29/month. You'll land on Setup:
    merge tag, embed block, and branding, all on one page.
  <% end %>
</p>

<div class="card">
  <%= render "form", publication: @publication, url: account_publications_path %>
</div>
